From: iStoreOS build fix
Subject: [PATCH] regulator: fixed: remove unused local variable

The preceding regulator patch returns dev_err_probe() directly, leaving
the local ret variable unused when CONFIG_WERROR is enabled.

--- a/drivers/regulator/fixed.c
+++ b/drivers/regulator/fixed.c
@@ -179,7 +179,6 @@ static int reg_fixed_voltage_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	struct fixed_dev_type *drvtype = of_device_get_match_data(dev);
 	struct regulator_config cfg = { };
 	enum gpiod_flags gflags;
-	int ret;
 
 	drvdata = devm_kzalloc(&pdev->dev, sizeof(struct fixed_voltage_data),
 			       GFP_KERNEL);
